  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FilecoinOASIS v2.0.2\n\nConnects the OASIS to the Filecoin decentralised storage network via the Lotus JSON-RPC API (Glif.io public endpoint). Maps Filecoin addresses to OASIS Avatars and storage deals/CIDs to OASIS Holons. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.1\n- feat: add 6 new OASIS providers — BlueSky, Matrix, Filecoin, Algorand, Ceramic, Basechain (b2e78ba)\n- feat: complete all 13 unpublished NuGet providers to publish-ready standard — READMEs, release notes, logo, metadata, copyright (0263a2b)\n- fix: put every project in a solution and fix the bugs that exposed (4612aa0)\n- Integrate provider capabilities and reuse deployed service configuration (8ac7f1f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Blockchain/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.FilecoinOASIS",
